Package: BayesCircRhy
Title: An R package for circadian rhythmicity with Bayesian method
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Date: 2024-02-07
Author: Zhiguang Huo, Haocheng Ding
Maintainer: Haocheng Ding <hading@augusta.edu>
biocViews: Statistical Method, Software
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Description: The Bayesian circadian rhythmicity detection method (BayesCircRhy) demonstrates superior statistical power and reliability for identifying circadian rhythms in transcriptomic applications. It effectively incorporates prior biological knowledge and offers a comprehensive framework for quantifying uncertainty in predictions and parameter estimates, which is invaluable for assessing the variability and robustness of circadian biomarkers.
License: GPL-3
Depends: R (>= 3.6), MASS, invgamma
Imports: MASS, invgamma
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
